    "en": {
      "trackName": "Quarti: Word Puzzles",
      "description": "Enjoy uninterrupted wordplay with Quarti: Word Puzzles! You get ad-free brain teasers with sleek design, customizable themes, and game modes for every mood. Whether you’re relaxing or racing the clock, Quarti delivers a premium puzzle experience.\n\nWhy You’ll Love Quarti:\n\n\n- No Ads: Play without distractions.\n- Sleek Design: A visually stunning interface.\n- Varying Difficulty: Challenges for beginners to experts.\n- Free Daily Hints: Get help when you need it.\n- Skip Puzzles: Move past tough spots with ease.\n- Custom Themes: Personalize with your favorite colors.\n- Zen Mode: Unwind with unlimited hints, one word at a time.\n- Lightning Mode: Beat your speed record solving 10 words.\n\nWith hundreds of levels and fresh puzzles added regularly, Quarti keeps your mind sharp and entertained. Download now and elevate your word puzzle adventure!",
      "releaseNotes": "Introducing the new Apple Watch companion app. Play on the go, anytime. Perfect for quick puzzle games.",
